\f1\fs22 Outside, Tony watched, struck dumb, as Sarah emerged. His heart leapt; he took a step forward\'97then stopped as Alexander swooped. As he saw Alexander at Sarah\'92s side\'97saving or shepherding, it was hard to tell\'97he faltered, feeling every inch the impostor. If only Sarah would look his way. If only she\'92d need him\'97just a word, a glance\'97he\'92d transform, instantly, into the hero he wished she would call for.\
